stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    classDef deferred fill:#F2F2F0,stroke:#8A8A85,stroke-dasharray:5 3,color:#5A5A57

    [*] --> new : first message, restaurant open,<br/>menu within 4,096 characters
    new --> browsing : same transaction (CAS)<br/>welcome and numbered menu sent

    browsing --> fulfillment_choice : finish word, cart not empty,<br/>restaurant delivers
    browsing --> cart_review : finish word, cart not empty,<br/>pickup only or fulfilment already chosen

    fulfillment_choice --> cart_review : pickup, or a delivery address<br/>(1 to 300 characters)
    fulfillment_choice --> browsing : edit (fulfilment cleared)<br/>or cancel (cart emptied)

    cart_review --> browsing : edit (fulfilment kept), cancel,<br/>or every line now unavailable
    cart_review --> order_placed : confirm word, every line available<br/>(CAS, then the order is written)

    browsing --> abandoned : next message after 60 min of silence
    fulfillment_choice --> abandoned : next message after 60 min of silence
    cart_review --> abandoned : next message after 60 min of silence

    awaiting_payment
    class awaiting_payment deferred

    order_placed --> [*]
    abandoned --> [*]

    note right of browsing
        Item numbers, cart, menu and
        remove N stay in browsing.
        Three messages in a row not understood:
        one handoff message with the restaurant's
        contact number; the state does not change.
    end note

    note right of awaiting_payment
        In the schema for online payment
        (deferred). Never entered today.
    end note

    note right of order_placed
        A closed state. The next message
        opens a new session with the
        welcome and the full menu.
    end note

    note right of abandoned
        No job: expiry is checked when the next
        message arrives, which then starts a new
        conversation. The abandoned session
        keeps its cart; no order is touched.
    end note
